      "status": "MISSING",
      "chunk_id": null,
      "quote": null,
      "reason": "No description of assumptions made about missing or unclear study information is provided in the retrieved evidence. The only related statement is that complications could not be evaluated 'owing to insufficient data' (text_9), but no assumptions or handling rules for missing/unclear data items are reported."
