      "chunk_id": "text_4",
      "quote": "Two investigators (Fu-ming Wang and Shasha Yu) independently assessed the quality of included studies... Any controversies on the results of data extraction and quality assessment were resolved by further discussion.",
      "reason": "Number of reviewers (two), independent assessment, and disagreement resolution by discussion are all reported."
