{
  "item_id": "PRISMA_2020_13a",
  "elements": [
    {
      "element_id": "prisma_2020_13a_e1",
      "status": "PARTIAL",
      "chunk_id": "text_3",
      "quote": "Two investigators (Fu-ming Wang and Sha-sha Yu) independently selected the suitable publications according to following inclusion criteria: (1) Participants: subjects diagnosed with Bell's palsy. (2) Intervention: manual acupuncture or electric acupuncture. (3) Control: other therapy regimens except acupuncture. (4) Outcome: Adjusted risk estimates with 95% confidence interval (CI) on the association of acupuncture and efficacy of Bell's palsy included cured rate and effective rate. (5) Study design: RCTs.",
      "reason": "The manuscript describes general eligibility criteria and independent study selection, and text_5 outlines planned syntheses (subgroups by age, design, sample size, etc., plus sensitivity and cumulative analyses). However, it does not describe the process used to decide which studies were eligible for each specific synthesis (e.g., tabulating study intervention characteristics and comparing them against the planned groups for each synthesis).",
      "confidence": 70
    }
  ],
  "confidence": 70
}

{
  "item_id": "PRISMA_2020_13b",
  "elements": [
    {
      "element_id": "prisma_2020_13b_e1",
      "status": "PARTIAL",
      "chunk_id": "text_3",
      "quote": "The percentage of cured was called cure rate, and the percentage of markedly effective or effective were called total effective rate.",
      "reason": "The manuscript describes some data preparation: outcome definitions (cure rate and total effective rate derived from the House-Brackmann grading, text_3) and choice of effect measure (RR with 95% CI as common measure, text_5). However, no methods are reported for handling missing summary statistics or for data conversions/calculations (e.g., deriving RRs from reported counts), so the description is incomplete."
    }
  ],
  "confidence": 85
}

{
  "item_id": "PRISMA_2020_13c",
  "elements": [
    {
      "element_id": "prisma_2020_13c_e1",
      "status": "MISSING",
